  "binding_convention": "capture selects a permitted capture-NN.json; source_id is its record id. Every row, main/correction column, printed string and next-main string below is bound to that record, not reconstructed from exact roots. 'square' IDs are locally disambiguated from IV root IDs.",
  "tables": {
    "III": "Normalize approximate base by an integer power of ten; square that power exactly. Corrections use the place of the last printed square digit, not a universal decimal unit. Only direct square cells are used here.",
    "IV": "Below 10: main step 0.01 and fourth-digit correction step 0.001. At/above 10: main step 0.1 and fourth-digit correction step 0.01. Root correction unit is 0.001. Lower-additive route used explicitly.",
    "identity_limit": "Source-rule container identifies a 2010 stereotype edition. Historical equivalence is NOT established and not required as an additional Stage1 gate."
  },
